[{"id":165530785,"discussion_id":"3b7819294d1aa466cf08fdeb31d12d427a331aba","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n zhang-wenbo-beat, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-17T17:34:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T22:01:01+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165530808,"discussion_id":"ea7afb119ba347f762e567882be12d853c545971","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-17T17:34:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T17:34:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165531010,"discussion_id":"fb2d47d5f00ae457ba98dea6cce9126bed541300","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要修复了多个AscendC确定性算子（包括ScatterAdd、ScatterNd、ScatterNdAdd等）内核初始化过程中潜在的内存访问时序或数据竞争问题。在硬件流水线并行执行场景下，由于对工作空间或全局内存的初始化操作与后续的内存访问或计算操作之间缺乏明确的同步，可能导致数据不一致或非确定性结果。修改旨在通过增加硬件事件同步，确保内存初始化的正确顺序和完整性，从而提升内核执行的确定性和可靠性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案的核心是在相关算子的初始化函数（如`Init`、`InitWspZero`）中，在关键的内存初始化操作之后，显式地插入对`HardEvent::MTE3_V`硬件事件的等待操作。具体通过调用`GetTPipePtr()->FetchEventID`、`SetFlag`和`WaitFlag`等AscendC API来实现。这确保了针对特定内存区域（如`updateSumWsGm_`、`workspaceCoreLogicCoreSumId_`等）的初始化事务在垂直方向上已完成，之后才允许后续操作访问这些内存，从而消除了竞态条件，保证了数据一致性。部分PR还优化了初始化流程的顺序，以提升执行效率。","created_at":"2026-03-17T17:36:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T17:36:10+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165783638,"discussion_id":"d6901bc6ab142bd5f1d7a2f2b400b57aa091b54e","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-19T18:57:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T18:57:26+08:00","user":{"id":"6924693a3197e961bc3638b8","login":"zhang-wenbo-beat","object_id":"6924693a3197e961bc3638b8","name":"zhang-wenbo-beat","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/be/dc/9721b02e28dcbd25a09cf05b6e3e56aceb1008f2a316da8353f0c9f4947d0abf.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhang-wenbo-beat"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165783786,"discussion_id":"eff06e6485ba5082f9263152ca7082af0318e677","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https:/